                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                           <td>The patient shows a moderately reduced glomerular filtration rate (GFR) at 41 mL/min/1.73 m², indicating stage 3b chronic kidney disease. This warrants further evaluation of renal function, monitoring for progression, and assessment for underlying causes and complications. Clinical correlation and nephrology consultation are recommended.</td>
